Size as **width × height × depth**. All positions are **seen from the front**: the front is the controller side (north at rotation 0), so left is east and right is west. The machine rotates, the positions stay the same. Level 1 is the lowest block layer, cell 1 from the left is the left edge, cell 1 from the front the front face. Item ports: **yellow** = in (hopper on top or item pipe), **copper orange** = out (hands items to chests, hoppers and item pipes next to it once a second).
